        "TileImage": "$($repository 9b0d0651-4f81-40e5-bf2a-5aec6fd763a5).Image",
        "Description": "Recently, the agency has caught wind of an operation taking place at the Kronstadt corporate HQ. This operation is reguarding a new technology that would essentially replace human soldiers. Kronstadt was prominently involved in the Tungan Valley mass casualty event. Kronstadt&apos;s legal team has helped cover up the corporations involvment. Corporate has also covered up a fatal accident involving the faulty technology.\r\r Eliminate all 5 targets  and avoid collateral damage as far as possible.",
